<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Editor Foto AI</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f9;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #333;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 1rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 2rem;
        }

        main {
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        .gallery {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .gallery img {
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 10px;
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }

        .gallery img:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 1rem;
            background-color: #333;
            color: #fff;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Editor Foto AI</h1>
    </header>

    <main>
        <h2>Exposição de Fotos</h2>
        <p>Bem-vindo à nossa galeria interativa. Explore as imagens processadas com nossa tecnologia AI.</p>

        <div class="gallery">
            <img src="https://s329.erome.com/3112/oImYQfrO/3N1mCBdo.jpeg?v=1725631920" alt="Foto 1">
            <img src="https://s329.erome.com/3112/oImYQfrO/YjnQ6XNV.jpeg?v=1725631920" alt="Foto 2">
            <img src="https://s329.erome.com/3112/oImYQfrO/DtrAwN7v.jpeg?v=1725631920" alt="Foto 3">
            <img src="https://s329.erome.com/3112/oImYQfrO/tBzd7PTP.jpeg?v=1725631920" alt="Foto 4">
            <img src="https://s329.erome.com/3112/oImYQfrO/Gve91eOH.png?v=1725631920" alt="Foto 1">
            <img src="https://s329.erome.com/3112/oImYQfrO/IgfScS7N.png?v=1725631920" alt="Foto 2">
            <img src="https://s329.erome.com/3112/oImYQfrO/cvLqztfG.png?v=1725631920" alt="Foto 3">
            <img src="https://s329.erome.com/3112/oImYQfrO/Ox6oNXfI.jpeg?v=1725631920" alt="Foto 4">
            <img src="https://s329.erome.com/3112/oImYQfrO/hXXW6jBu.png?v=1725631920" alt="Foto 1">
            <img src="https://s329.erome.com/3112/oImYQfrO/HUV1od1z.jpeg?v=1734546679" alt="Foto 2">
            <img src="https://s329.erome.com/3112/oImYQfrO/THLULJX4.jpeg?v=1725631920" alt="Foto 3">
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2025 Editor Foto AI. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
